  "details": "Right now the world lists for both the Scary and Hangout worlds section never change their order, giving an impression that the order listed is a ranking. This incorrectly conveys to players that the worlds at the top are \"better\" than the worlds near the bottom, and many don't even bother scrolling down to visit any of the other worlds that users have spent a lot of time and effort creating, believing them to be worse.\n\nThis would be fine if the Spookality worlds were ranked, but the world jam hasn't been a ranked competition for multiple years now.",
